// headwear.hat, front still: a low-crowned, wide-brimmed hat. Its x pixels
// hide the hair that would show above the brim: a topknot's bun and the
// edges of a hair cap beside the crown.
canvas 64 64
anchor 32 64
occludes hair_beard
frame still 0
